"In the second sample test, there must be "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"p3 = 1"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"p4 = 2"},{"kind":"text","text":". The two permutations satisfying the conditions are: (3,4,1,2,5), (5,4,1,2,3)."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"F","problemCode":"698F","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/698/problem/F"}